  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"2034\">\n<p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1901\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1899\">CSF3R Positive (with typical clinical picture):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"2034\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1971\">\n<p data-start=\"1906\" data-end=\"1971\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Strongly supports <strong data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1944\">diagnosis of CNL</strong>, per WHO/ICC guidelines.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1974\" data-end=\"2034\">\n<p data-start=\"1976\" data-end=\"2034\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May guide use of <strong data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2033\">JAK inhibitors or targeted therapies</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<p data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2113\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2111\">Negative for CSF3R but other myeloid mutations (SETBP1, ASXL1, JAK2):</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<p data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2209\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">May suggest <strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2191\">atypical CML or other myeloproliferative neoplasms (MPNs)</strong>; not classic CNL.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2339\">\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2252\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2250\">No Pathogenic Mutations Detected:</strong></span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2339\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2339\">\n<p data-start=\"2257\" data-end=\"2339\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">Does not exclude diagnosis; <strong data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2338\">clinical and morphologic correlation is mandatory</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
